MatchingService ..> CheckerInput : reads
MatchingService ..> CheckerResult : creates
InteractionCheckerController --> DrugSafetyService
DrugSafetyService ..> SafetyReport : creates
NotebookController --> NotebookService
NotebookService o-- LocalNotebookStore
